nting for a fight  and when he gets our scent there is no  stopping him  which leads to our next myth what  happens when wolverine  and dr doom meet a very nice easy one  right  well in standard games this can be  difficult as wolverine is so overpowered  we are eliminated before we know it the  trick with wolverine is to get him to  chase us  inside a vehicle the extra speed can  keep him at bay  we made it all the way to doom's domain  and wolverine did not disappoint  he went on the warpath until he found  doctor doom  here's what happened well he sort of  just stood there looking  at doom for a while and we actually had  to nudge him in manually  to get this show on the road doom does  get some big hits in  but when wolverine goes to town he  always comes out victorious  it certainly looks like wolverine is the  strongest boss in fortnite history  which leads to our next myth  iron man will take down wolverine at  stark industries  i like this myth and i like the guy's  name well played tony stank  as we all know wolverine will follow us  anywhere on the island  so we jumped into fortnite but this time  use battle lab so anybody can try this  one out  on the plus side this means we could be  killed multiple times on the bad side  bosses won't get knocked in this form  but anyway here's a time lapse of us  trying our best to get weapon x  all the way to stark industries it took  forever it really did  we died many times but once we got him  there and both bosses saw one another  the action started here's what happened  wow wow not even close tony stark had  zero chance at all  and neither did any of his bots  wolverine is so op  we'll try this again as soon as another  boss is added to the game  next myth please sarah reba says  myth what happens when iron man and  doctor doom meet each other  this one is super simple but also the  hardest to make work  there is seemingly no way to get stark  to doom or vice versa without knocking  one down  here's the best we did remember the bot  rest technique from earlier  in which stark is picked up anywhere on  the island as long as a bot is near  well we used this strat to get tony to  walk as close to doom's domain as  possible  the plan was simple use shock waves and  crash mats to push him into the poi  but it was so painful to say the least  stark would stop for no reason  he'd change direction without warning  he'd even swim in the river for a few  minutes  i personally think he was taking a leak  and then the storm rolled in and he  wouldn't move at  all however we tried we couldn't get  stark into doom's domain  so this myth isn't busted or chased this  is still open-ended this one is for you  guys  can you get stark to doom without  knocking any of them and if you're  wondering this is what  happens when you take a knocked iron man  to doom's domain  wow i suppose i should have expected  that  [Music]  oh here's a really good one cody munding  says  myth mystique can become a husk after  killing one and using her remote  oh i like this one okay right now there  are no husks or fiends in battle royale  so this one is a save the world question  i likey  so i jumped into the pve mode and chose  mystique and her shape-shifting emote  then i shot a zombie and tried to mimic  them  [Music]  sadly this is a busted myth to be sure i  tried this multiple times  no positive results mystique's  shapeshifter emote does not work  and save the world rip the dream  and now are you ready for the best myth  of 2020  check this out sega dreamcast says  the ghost and shadow henchmen can defeat  wolverine  i know what you're thinking right now  this is impossible this is stupid maybe  if tony stark and dr doom can't take on  wolverine  how on earth can two former henchmen do  it  well to you i say watch this if you  don't know about the greatest bromance  in history let me update you quickly  at the start of season 4 two henchmen  from the old ghost and shadow factions  found each other and instead of warring  they decided to become  friends they danced the days away at the  local gas station before getting a room  at the hotel in lazy lake  it's a fragile truce i admit but it's  becoming stronger every week in chapter  two  and now we're gonna lead a self-healing  maniac like wolverine over there  i'm sorry in advance here we go the  journey over using a vehicle  is far easier than i expected as long as  wolverine can be kept at bay  a few minutes later and we've arrived at  lazy lake and we've got wolverine close  enough to the two henchmen  the shadow dude doesn't want any part of  this but the ghost henchmen  was all over wolverine with aim like a  stormtrooper  over the next 10 minutes they fought  [Music]  [Music]  until it finally happened the henchman  beat wolverine  in a heads-up fight what a moment in  history  a new boss has arrived  during the scuffle the shadow henchmen  actually did come to life  and tried to take out the ghost henchmen  we didn't allow that  but let's go further into this like with  all our myths we check them twice to  make sure they're fully tested  and this is what went down the second  time all three men were trapped in the  basement of the hotel  and both ghost and shadow teamed up to  take down weapon x  teamwork makes the dream work let's  ignore the fact that they uh started  fighting each other straight afterwards  the news here is that the toughest sobs  in fortnite right now  are the henchmen my mind is blown this  is why i love myth chaser videos  before we go i have one last myth for  you and it's from irebios  sorry if i'm saying that wrong who says  what happens when wolverine goes into a  rift  what glider does he use a perfect myth  to end thanks to battle labs this is a  far easier myth than it would be in a  typical squads match  a simple chase and then a bait and  switch and now wolverine  is heading into that rift  and there it is wolverine does indeed  have a glider  another thing to note is that wolverine  will actually use his glider to get back  home  he doesn't just go straight down like  the other bosses do he's going back to  weeping wood to wherever he is  he likes it there so there we have it a  good episode if i do say so myself  gotta love those henchmen on screen are  the names that i've been trying to thank  for  two weeks now sorry it's taken me so  long but here you go thank you so much  for using code adamaru and supporting me  i'll be back in my dms later this week  to thank more of you awesome people  in person i'm adam from playstation  grenade you're awesome stay that way  i'll see you next time  [Music]  [Music]  you

